  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://www.isro.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Indian Space Research Organisation (ISRO)</a></span> Satish Dhawan Space Centre (SDSC SHAR) has released the Admit Card for the post of Scientist/Engineer, Technical Assistant, Scientific Assistant, Technician, Draughtsman, Nurse, Fireman, Cook, and Driver. This recruitment has been issued for 141 posts. Online applying process for ISRO SDSC SHAR Various Posts Recruitment 2025 were accepted from 16 October 2025 to 21 November 2025. The Examination is going to conducted on 04 September 2026. Candidates must download their ISRO SDSC SHAR Various Posts Admit Card 2026 which has given below.&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">ISRO-Satish Dhawan Space Centre (SDSC SHAR), Sriharikota (AP)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">ISRO SDSC SHAR Various Posts Admit Card 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Advt No. SDSC SHAR/RMT/01/2025</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>16 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>21 November 2025 (Extended)</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>14 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>04 September 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>01 September 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffcc00; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For Scientist / TA / Library Assistant / Nurse&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, EWS, OBC <strong>: Rs. 750/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, PH, ESM <strong>: Rs. 750/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All Category Female <strong>: Rs. 750/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffcc00; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For All Other Vacancies&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, EWS, OBC <strong>: Rs. 500/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, PH, ESM <strong>: Rs. 500/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All Category Female <strong>: Rs. 500/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffcc00; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Fees Refunded Appearing after Exam&nbsp;</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffcc00; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For Scientist / TA / Library Assistant / Nurse</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, EWS, OBC <strong>: Rs. 500/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, PH, ESM <strong>: Rs. 750/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All Category Female <strong>: Rs. 750/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffcc00; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For All Other Vacancies&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, EWS, OBC <strong>: Rs. 400/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, PH, ESM <strong>: Rs. 500/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All Category Female <strong>: Rs. 500/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>ISRO SDSC SHAR Various Posts Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 14 November 2025</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Fireman&nbsp;<strong>: 18-25 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Scientist / Engineer&nbsp;<strong>: 18-28/30 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">For All Other Posts&nbsp;<strong>: 18-35 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per ISRO SDSC SHAR Various Posts Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-ali