12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.236%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Eligibility&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.764%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Scientist / Engineer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.236%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">B.E/B.Tech or M.E/M.Tech/M.Sc. (Engg.) in relevant discipline with minimum 65% marks.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.764%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Technical Assistant</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.236%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Diploma in Relevant Engineering from a recognised University/ Institution.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.764%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Scientific Assistant</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.236%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">B.Sc. with Chemistry / Computer Science / Degree in Fine Arts (Photography) / Visual Arts (Cinematography).</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.764%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Library Assistant ‘A’</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.236%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Master’s Degree in Library Science.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.764%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Technician ‘B’&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.236%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">10th Passed with ITI / NTC / NAC in Related Trade.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.764%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">D